{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDI0L0FiZXJkZWVuJTIwJTI4MjAyNCUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Aberdeen","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/qC3Dd0FLzwHDJStRZPNNjp68PM1.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AwDNAyyrFrT4ipZzThj72AvkHbt.jpg","description":"An idyllic childhood with her mooshum and kookum, or grandparents, in her community of Peguis First Nation dissipates as Aberdeen’s hard-partying and absentee parents distances her from that haven.  Now an adult, sleeping on public benches, Winnipeg-based Aberdeen is in survival mode. The last remaining stable parts of her life begin slipping away — her reliable brother Boyd is ill and gives up Aberdeen’s grandkids to the foster care system. Then she loses her ID.\n\nReleased 6 Sept 2024 · Canada · Language: English · 83 min\nStudio: Back to Space Productions, Farpoint Films\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2024","genres":["Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"8.3","runtime":"83 min","cast":["Gail Maurice","Billy Merasty","Jennifer Podemski","Liam Stewart-Kanigan","Ryan Rajendra Black","Onalee Ames","Bradley Sawatzky","Robert Nahum"],"director":["Ryan Cooper","Eva Thomas"],"released":"2024-09-06T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"The System is Broken","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Ryan Cooper","character":"Director"},{"name":"Gail Maurice","character":"Aberdeen","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/i6RjUHk86qvI6xljud4faB6lHq1.jpg"},{"name":"Billy Merasty","character":"Alfred","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/udFrp3fQF4fUBTQXPr2pKDmDVlJ.jpg"},{"name":"Jennifer Podemski","character":"Grace","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5LlDHLrj0QRyQ0IpPgXr419tXRF.jpg"},{"name":"Liam Stewart-Kanigan","character":"Raven","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/qGVVX9iWmOp9Cadmqd1lUZG1y5B.jpg"},{"name":"Ryan Rajendra Black","character":"Boyd","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/m63j8bH9vCS5FPD3qgqmScnLyrY.jpg"},{"name":"Onalee Ames","cha